{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（27日）上午6時11分，警方接報，佐敦文景樓對開，一名年約50至60歲女子從高處墮下。救援人員到場，證實事主當場身亡。警方正調查事主身份及墮樓原因。</p><p>現場可見，警員以綠色帳篷遮蓋遺體及檢走相信屬於事主的物品。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員檢走證物。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260827/1169549796399124480430912.jpeg/TZqutnjWySi6-Yrx160Z1QEWJyAOAJV2mxEvq74RL6s\"/><figcaption>警員檢走證物。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員圍封現場。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260827/1169549802091057152265184.jpeg/_UG7jInU86MN5hWHeDm2HSZ9eZZqcBDFtYIhO5CCITs\"/><figcaption>警員圍封現場。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人員以綠色帳篷遮蓋遺體。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260827/1169549799276548096091543.jpeg/ZGBgck1SI1u3J6A3ozDIHCK5mkIkA-EBiwqQuK4KkLg\"/><figcaption>人員以綠色帳篷遮蓋遺體。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T01:25:07.504727+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}